      "title": {
        "en": "Caring veterinary and reception personnel"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The majority of pet owners praise the surgery team on Easterly Road, singling out veterinary surgeons Alice, Simon, and Emily for their dedication. Clients describe receptionists who offer warm greetings and supportive advice during stressful visits. A small minority of reviewers complained about abrupt reception interactions and disputes regarding fees."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thoughtful attention for varied pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the gentle handling shown towards dogs, cats, and rabbits during routine and urgent appointments. Pet parents note that clinicians take extra time to play with anxious dogs to settle their nerves and manage complex long-term conditions like canine diabetes. Owners describe returning home with pets that feel calm and secure."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Proactive follow-up and helpful advice"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the clear guidance received regarding preventative health, vaccinations, and recovery care. Reviewers appreciate that vets telephone between appointments to check on unwell pets and message after procedures. While one reviewer experienced a communication breakdown regarding prescription costs, most praise the informative dialogue."
      }
    }
  ],
